# The Navigator nests a project found under a task or a note directly under the nearest project above it.
file <<END
Garden:
	- Plant bulbs
		Tulips:
			- Red ones
	Notes on soil
		Compost:
			- Turn pile
END
keys <C-g>
see ▾Garden                                    3 │
see    Tulips                                  1 │
see    Compost                                 1 │
type comp
see │▌   Compost
keys <Enter>
see 󰋜 › Garden › Notes on soil › Compost
quit
